ef="/encyclopedia/ranulf-de-gernon-4th-earl-of-chester">Ranulf of Chester</a> at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-lincoln-1141">Battle of Lincoln</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1160</span><span class="rf-text">Madog dies and Powys is divided into Powys Fadog and Powys Wenwynwyn</span></li></ol>
